 "accueil.span.le-consensus-est-une-preuve-d-autorite-pas": "<b>The consensus is a proof of authority, not a proof of stake.</b> The Parlia\n      engine can do proof of stake; the Coinbosa system contract, in its current\n      version, exposes a fixed validator set, with no bond and no slashing. No\n      validator is risking funds today.",
