 "developpeurs.span.deux-limites-a-connaitre-avant-de-batir-de": "<b>Two limits to know before building on it.</b> There is no WebSocket endpoint:\n        subscriptions are unavailable, an application has to poll the node. And state\n        history is not guaranteed across the full depth of the chain — reading a\n        balance at an old block would require an archive node, which is not deployed.",
