 "developpeurs.span.les-18-decimales-ne-sont-pas-un-reglage-l": "<b>The 18 decimals are not a setting.</b> The base unit of an Ethereum virtual machine\n        is the wei, a value hard-wired into gas accounting as well as into every wallet.\n        No field allows it to be changed.",
