 "ecosysteme.span.un-iban-n-est-pas-universel-un-iban-europe": "<b>An IBAN is not universal.</b> A European IBAN is issued under a European license;\n        an account opened in another jurisdiction falls under another authority,\n        another partner and another process. Serving several regions requires\n        several partnerships, not a single contract. Identity checks and transaction\n        monitoring apply according to the rules of each territory served, to the\n        standards of the partner that holds the license.",
 "ecosysteme.span.un-raccordement-sera-annonce-lorsqu-il-fon": "<b>A connection will be announced when it works, not when it is decided.</b> Presenting a\n        planned connection as established would be misleading.",
